WEBVTT

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.090
Morning!

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.850
Hot out, ain't it?

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.380
Privet, Mio.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.790
Soon will be summer, yes?

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.880
Accursed Sun.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.890
Isn't it a bit too hot
to dress like that, Ranran?

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.950
...Again, to address me as such—

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.850
A fan it is called?

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.010
Yeah! Cool, isn't it?

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:31.440
Svezho!

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.320
The sylphs frolic!

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.740
Ta-da!

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:37.630
Ever tried this trick?

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:43.950
Holodno!

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.500
It is cold!

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.210
Shiva's breath!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.890
...And last up...

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:49.980
Ta-da!

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.730
Good morning!

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:52.850
Morning.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.380
What's up?

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.690
Good morning.

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:57.690
Accursed Sun.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.690
Morning!

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.680
What's with the cushion?

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.020
Whadd'ya think?

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.220
Isn't it cool?

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.080
Is it yours?

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.060
You got it!

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:10.060
Let's fill this room with tons of stuff!

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.230
Like, <i>our</i> stuff?

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:46.190
Take me to your leader.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.680
...It feels so nice...

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:46.190
Doesn't it?

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:49.080
Do we even need to have these meetings?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:55.340
Yeah? I thin' i's fun
when everybo'y ge's toge'er.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.340
Bringing in personal items?

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.460
Yeah!

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:01.220
It'll really brighten up the office!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:05.780
...Yes, it might. However—

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.100
Producer.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:09.940
Robot talk?

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:12.350
...My apol—

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.170
Sorry.

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:19.650
If you ask meow,
I say we should keep it work-related.

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:23.560
Oh, come on. What about
those cat ears, Miku-meow?

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.950
Th-They're work-related!

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:27.530
They are?

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:34.440
I just thought that it'd bring out
more of our personalities.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.210
...Your opinio—

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.800
What do you think about it?

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:43.050
I think a little wouldn't hurt.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.090
I'm for i' too!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:48.680
I wanna know wha' everbo'y's bringin'!

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.580
It sounds like fun!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.210
I think so too!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.940
I wanna put a ton of stickers everywhere!

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.660
I'd rather keep meow professional
and private lives separate.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:03.020
I kinda like the cool vibe the room's got.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:04.950
Looks like we agree for once.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:08.870
What? Isn't it better
to have fun while working?

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.950
But it's work, and work meowns
we need a little stress.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.920
Oh, come on. Why?

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.100
Loosen up a little!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:18.920
I'm saying we need to draw a line.
Do mew understand?

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:20.200
...Perhaps a com—

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.900
Let's do this:

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:26.970
You can bring one personal item each.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.850
One each?

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.810
Can I bring anything
as long as it's one thing?

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:38.670
Within reason.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.800
...Do we have a consen—

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.780
What do you think?

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:45.500
...Well...

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.820
I guess we could try it out.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.950
All right!

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:50.330
What should I bring?

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.050
What should I bring?

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.240
How about stickers?

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.080
Yeah! I have to bring my sticker collection!

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.080
Producer!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.460
I have a lot of them too!

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.580
Thanks!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.260
Um, right. Yeah.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.490
One thing, huh?

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:02.320
What should I bring?

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.000
You've brought a bunch of stuff already.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:06.630
No, that's already here. What else should I bring?

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:08.980
Oh my. It sounds like we're having fun here.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:10.640
Good morning!

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.610
Producer, it's about time.

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.410
Yes.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:18.020
A CD debut?

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.230
The second wave?

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:20.900
Yes.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:24.360
Wh-Who's debuting this time?

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:25.470
Me, me!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:26.860
I wanna, I wanna!

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:28.320
Me too!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.490
I wanna too!

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:35.290
Sounds like everyone else wants to,
so I'll pass this time.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.040
Guess it's my time to rock.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:43.830
This time, it's Kanzaki Ranko.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.550
You will have a solo debut.

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:48.150
Wow!

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:49.480
Good job, Ranko!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.800
You go, Ranran!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.050
...That ends—

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.350
P!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.970
Who else?

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.890
Is it another double unit debut?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:03.290
We intend to do so for the next wave.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.370
...But for now...

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.190
Please wait.

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:11.900
Okay meow.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:13.330
We'll wait for more mews.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.810
Ranko, mew can do it!

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:23.960
The powers of darkness shall I unleash!

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.800
Ranko's so lucky.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:37.020
I hope my CD debut's coming up soon.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:41.020
P said the next wave'll be two trios.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.930
For meow, we'll just have to believe in him.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.220
You're right.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:47.400
Yeah.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.530
...That aside...

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:53.030
Does Anzu meowd to do this every day?

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:57.660
Anzu! Come ou'!

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.620
Hey, what kind of song
do you think Ranko will sing?

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:05.230
I'd guess something gothic.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.760
What's "gothic" mean?

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:10.040
Mew know, like the clothes
she's always wearing.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.050
Whoa, that's totally rocking!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.890
At the moment, we only have a rough mix,

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:20.560
but the composer is writing
the song based on your image.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:23.360
Oh! The waves of my soul!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:25.310
Indeed, you do possess the Eye!

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:28.540
I'm glad it's to your liking.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:33.150
While the lyricist is crafting the lyrics,

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:36.320
we'd like to begin producing a music video.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:39.330
"The prince of darkness,
child of the night,

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:42.890
reigning over the bloodstained
land with crimson terror."

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:50.000
We hope to keep a "dark" theme
that matches your image.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:53.180
The concept will be
..."True Gothic Horror," with—

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:55.010
Kanzaki?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:59.910
Inscribed on this scroll
is a form from aeons past.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:05.440
Once brimmed with mana,
no longer could I remain a child of the night.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.440
Now!

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:09.470
The time has come to break
the seal and release the wings!

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.940
To unleash my soul!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:24.960
Are you concerned with the current plans?

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:26.560
Yes!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.090
Anything in particular?

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.090
Once possessed of a lofty post,

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:36.840
her pure and innocent wings are dyed black,

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:40.350
and ultimately awakens,
the true Prince of Darkness.

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:45.120
"True..."

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.640
"Prince of Darkness..."

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:53.280
So the image we have proposed
doesn't match your own?

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:58.020
My apologies, but I can't
seem to notice the difference.

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:02.120
Is it an important matter?

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.010
And then we got to wear
really, really frilly ones!

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:11.510
Huh? Ranran!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.970
How'd the meeting about the CD go?

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:23.600
Alas, that his Eye should be
clouded on the eve of my nativity.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:24.960
"Eye"?

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:27.190
"Clouded"?

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:30.480
The darkness engulfs me.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:34.400
Um... That means "good evening", right?

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.140
Good evening!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.140
Dargulfy to you too!

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.140
The darkness engulfs you.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:40.730
Wait, Ranko. We go together home!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:43.280
Oh, right, they live in the same dorm.

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.820
I wonder what's bothering her.

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:50.110
Yeah. She looked kind of upset.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.690
...Now that you mention it...

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:55.000
Did something happen?

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:04.040
You are doing how, Ranko?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.430
Is on your mind something?

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:10.340
O-On my mind?

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.860
You are seeming the down.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.270
Am I wrong?

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:22.240
For all utterances we sound, no secret art
exists to convey the truths within us.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:23.830
Chto?

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.100
I'm sorry.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.540
You speak hard words.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.170
Ranko,

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:36.420
is there any way I can to help you?

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:41.940
Kindhearted comrade, I thank you.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:44.180
But let it not weigh your heart.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:47.680
I shall overcome any hardship
which presents itself!

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:50.060
Welcome back.

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:52.160
Good evening.

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.870
Koume. Shouko.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:55.440
A good night.

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.240
Welcome back!

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.980
That wasn't me.
That was this little shiitake mushroom.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.910
What lovely griby.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.650
Shiitake?

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:05.700
...Um...

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.620
I ordered this movie online.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.330
Do you want to watch it tonight?

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.120
Can my shimeji mushrooms watch too?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.200
Um... Sure.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.980
...I-I, um...

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.840
h-have a ritual to conduct!

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.680
It's not <i>that</i> scary.

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:46.780
Salisbury Steak

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:49.750
Meow whole day was
...lessons, lessons, lessons...

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:50.750
Huh?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:51.910
Where's Ranko?

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:55.990
She ate earlier.
She had something to be doing.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.210
A "rich-yule"?

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.380
Ritual?

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:09.700
Done!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.560
Oh, Ranran, you can draw?

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:15.900
My barrier of souls, broken?!

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:18.460
No need to hide it. Lemme see!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.980
Touch not the taboo!

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:23.950
Is that your thing for the room, Ranran?

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:28.090
Th-This is my grimoire. A part of my soul.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:30.860
A mana vessel inseparable from me.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.520
...Um...

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.370
It's not?

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:37.880
Another vessel of power lies within.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.530
Oh!

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.380
What's inside?

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.300
You did it!

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.830
A hole in one! Awesome!

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.550
Wow! Wow!

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:53.060
Lemme try! Lemme try!

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:56.810
The breath of life fills the air.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:58.780
Krasivo.

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:01.090
Very pretty flowers.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.410
Are they from your shop, Rin?

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.390
Yeah.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:06.320
I thought it'd make it feel cooler.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.200
...So pretty...

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:15.040
Oh, Producer!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.580
...Um...

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:19.080
Would you like some tea?

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.080
Huh?

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:21.640
Oh.

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:22.760
Right.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:24.640
...Perhaps a—

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:26.840
Sure. Please.

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:30.080
Here, Producer.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.960
...Thank you ver—

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.370
Thanks.

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.850
How are they?

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:38.700
Right.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:39.870
...They are qui—

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:41.970
They're good.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:45.900
Maybe you should stick to the robot talk.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.990
My apolo... gies.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.410
Hey, guys, who brought that in?

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.390
Ranran did.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.540
She came in early to put it up.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:00.000
What is it?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.710
It looks like a horseshoe.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:02.980
What's that?

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.670
You put them on horses' hooves.

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:09.010
They're also supposed to keep
bad spirits away and bring good luck.

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.680
So that's what it's for!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:18.950
My faithful comrades,
I bring you blessings equal to all!

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:22.270
May Fortune smile upon you,
bathed in the holy light!

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:24.690
Uh, okay.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:26.460
Thanks, Ranko!

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.030
Thank you very much!

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:27.350
Thanks!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.980
It's lovely.

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:34.300
Would it work even better
with a four-leaf clover?

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:36.540
Um... Yes.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.540
Ranran's such a good girl!

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.080
Bringing a good luck charm for everyone!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:46.960
I thought Ranko'd bring
something scary like skulls and stuff!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.340
Skulls?

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.680
Or a bloodstained cross.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:51.880
Blood?

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:54.850
Ranko cannot stand horror.

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:55.720
Huh?!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.420
Really?

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:59.980
Horror movies are too scary for to watch.

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.330
...I can't either...

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.970
I wasn't expecting that.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:19.370
Um, Kanzaki.

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:21.120
...Regarding the project—

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:23.580
...P-Pro...

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.250
Is something wrong?

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.840
Provincial wind!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.720
"Provincial"?

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:36.190
Kanzaki.

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:39.600
...Earlier, you mentioned a "provincial wind"—

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.940
...P-Pro... Pro...

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.730
Proletarian literature!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.150
Kanzaki.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.070
Prologue!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.240
Propose!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:54.740
Professional!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.620
...Kanzaki, um...

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:59.530
...P-Pro...

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:03.410
...Pudding...

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.560
The burden proves
greater than ever expected.

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:14.660
Ranran!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:18.100
Do you want to show that to Producer?

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:20.210
Wh-What do you mean?

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:20.900
Huh?

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:21.930
You don't?

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:24.650
...W-Well, um...

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:30.110
'Tis yet early to open the grimoire.

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:33.260
What's inside your notebook?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.240
Touch not the taboo!

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.330
So we can't see it?

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:47.590
Come in.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:50.750
Do you have a minute?

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:51.810
Yes.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:55.670
Are you talking to Ranko?

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.300
...She seems to be avoiding me...

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:03.520
because I can't understand
what she's trying to tell me.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.390
No, she isn't.

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:07.670
Huh?

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.150
She isn't avoiding you.

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.460
Instead of trying to understand
what she's talking about,

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:15.650
why not try to understand her?

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:18.660
About Ranko?

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:23.040
She loves Salisbury steak, just like me!

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:25.500
I think that might work better.

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:27.130
Oh, I see.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.250
That sounds rough.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:32.500
It's hard to tell people how you feel.

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.340
...Sometimes...

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.840
When you have snacks,
it's a lot easier to talk.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:39.640
Kanzaki.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.900
...P-Pro...

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:45.610
Like when you came to pick us up.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:46.390
...Pro... Pro...

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:47.790
...Protein...

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.730
Do you have a minute?

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:01.030
The sky is pretty, isn't it?

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:04.910
The blazing hellfire scorches my flesh.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:10.520
...Yes, the sun is a little strong—

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:19.880
Thank you very much.

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:23.390
It's a lovely umbrella.

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:28.140
It gives a sense of
your tastes and preferences.

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:43.410
...These variegated sorcerer's stones—
will you receive them?

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.910
Thank you very much.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.600
How do you spend your weekends?

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:59.930
Out of the sight of God's Eye,
inscribing forbidden magicks into my grimoire.

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:02.950
What kind of music do you listen to?

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.940
Dark requiems.

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:06.800
Heavenly gospels.

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:08.620
Faerie dramas.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.720
All offered at the altar equally.

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:15.690
Do you like Salisbury steak?

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.730
I heard that you did.

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.450
Wh-What do you mean?!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.890
You dare to touch the taboo?

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:25.810
Me too.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.820
I like it too.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:30.620
Salisbury steak.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.280
Th-The forbidden fruit.

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.320
The crimson tonic replenishes one's mana.

00:19:38.020 --> 00:19:39.210
How's it going?

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:41.230
They're talking right now.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:43.360
Looks like it's working!

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:53.190
...Kanzaki—

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.900
...P-Pro...

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.400
...Pro... Pro...

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:01.190
...Pro...

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:03.710
Producer!

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:06.120
...I said it...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:07.950
What's this?

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.080
Would you mind answering a question?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:22.340
What led from this image to this image?

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:30.220
I think it's a very important matter.

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:34.100
Very well!

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.810
...Listen well, my servant—

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:39.620
no—my friend!

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:42.860
Now is the time for our souls to resonate!

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:47.910
Once brimmed with mana,
no longer a child of the night.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:51.260
Her once pure and
innocent wings are dyed black!

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:55.620
For the twelve wings, sealed for eternity,
should one the wrong path take,

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:59.050
that one shall ultimately awaken,
the true Prince of Darkness!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:05.620
...Wings...

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:11.690
Do you mean like a fallen angel?
A being that was once holy?

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:13.100
...So—

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:22.360
...So for the concept...

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.490
"Rosenburg 'Engel'"?

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:30.810
Yes.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.490
"Angel" in German.

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:42.560
...My friend—

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:44.960
no—Producer.

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:45.940
Everyone.

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:47.850
Thank you.

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:50.840
For hearing my voice.

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:53.200
Let's keep up the good work.

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:58.330
As my soul wills!

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:14.210
It's like our own personal castle!

00:23:16.930 --> 00:23:19.140
Accursed Sun.

00:23:19.140 --> 00:23:20.430
Good morning!

00:23:21.140 --> 00:23:22.830
Morning, Ranran!

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:24.650
...Again, to address me as such—

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:28.040
Everyone loves your debut CD!

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:30.610
You've got a concert later today, don't you?

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:35.220
The Moon fills, and the Sun falls to ruin.

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:38.430
The wings are released
in the abyssal darkness.

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:40.410
Huh? What's that mean?

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:45.920
Oh, so you'll be working late today too?

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:47.060
Huh?!

00:23:47.060 --> 00:23:49.340
How'd you understand that?!

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:52.770
"How"? You mean you didn't?

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:55.810
Huh?!

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:57.410
You could have told us.
